  triage:description "Post-merge audit of integrate/phase-AI (quality-mgr + qa-triage independent confirmation). Docs/plans/phase-ai/sprint-ai-5.md front matter (line 3) still reads 'status: proposed' despite AI.5 being fully implemented, merged, and closed. All other completed sprints in phase-AI (AI.1, AI.2, AI.3, AI.4, AI.6, AI.7, AI.8, AI.9) show 'status: complete' in their sprint-plan front matter. This is a documentation consistency issue. No evidence of incomplete AI.5 deliverables; the finding scope is docs-only (status field mismatch)." ;
